{
  "file_id": "3618",
  "text_count": 62,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������*sigh* How long are we gonna have\nto keep doing this...",
      "_offset": 1910,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "What does that black thing want\nwith us?",
      "_offset": 1974,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Well, we've got to stop it,\nwhatever it's doing. Let's look\nfor clues.",
      "_offset": 2015,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "There's someone here!",
      "_offset": 2086,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "You're back!",
      "_offset": 2108,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Is he talking to us?",
      "_offset": 2124,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Playing me for a fool, huh? Well,\nit's my turn!",
      "_offset": 2145,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "We have *no* idea what you're\ntalking about!",
      "_offset": 2193,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Agumon! Run!",
      "_offset": 2238,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Take that!",
      "_offset": 2251,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Aaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 2262,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "W-Waaaaaaait!",
      "_offset": 2272,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Who are you?",
      "_offset": 2286,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "I'm not exactly sure what's going\non, but I think you have him\nmistaken for someone else...",
      "_offset": 2299,
      "_length": 91,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Tai, get away from there! I'll\ntake him on!",
      "_offset": 2395,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "It's okay, Hackmon. Those eyes\ndon't look like they want to\nfight.",
      "_offset": 2442,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "They look like pretty gentle\neyes...",
      "_offset": 2509,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Looks like I was wrong, then.",
      "_offset": 2546,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "I'm Takuya Kanbara. Sorry for\nstartling you there...",
      "_offset": 2576,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "A human?!",
      "_offset": 2629,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "A human evolved into a Digimon?",
      "_offset": 2639,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Well, it's kinda like that...",
      "_offset": 2671,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Why'd you attack us all of a\nsudden?",
      "_offset": 2701,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Sorry about that. A while back,\nsome human with the same Digimon\nas you attacked me.",
      "_offset": 2738,
      "_length": 84,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "There's another one of me?",
      "_offset": 2823,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "I guess there's a copy of Agumon\nrunning around too, huh?",
      "_offset": 2850,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Considering what's happened so\nfar, I wouldn't be surprised.",
      "_offset": 2908,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Anyway, I'm glad we didn't end up\nfighting each other for some\nstupid reason...",
      "_offset": 2969,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Yeah, I'm glad we avoided that,\ntoo.",
      "_offset": 3049,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "I'm guessing you were trapped\nhere, too. Wanna help us out?",
      "_offset": 3086,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "You too, huh? ...Okay, sure!",
      "_offset": 3146,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "So, about what you were saying\nearlier... a *human* attacked you?",
      "_offset": 3175,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Hmm... He looked like a middle\nschool student, and he had an\nAgumon with him.",
      "_offset": 3241,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "But when he did, you were probably\na Digimon at the time...",
      "_offset": 3319,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Yeah, I was.",
      "_offset": 3379,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "A middle school student attacking\na Digimon...",
      "_offset": 3392,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "What kind of guy was that?",
      "_offset": 3439,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Well, he had a really strong\npunch...",
      "_offset": 3466,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "The last person to hit me that\nhard was the goalkeeper, during\none of our matches...",
      "_offset": 3504,
      "_length": 84,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Wait, you play soccer, too?",
      "_offset": 3589,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "You play?",
      "_offset": 3617,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Yeah, I'm in the soccer club.",
      "_offset": 3627,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Whoa!",
      "_offset": 3657,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "I tend to do a lot of heading, so\nour goalkeeper tends to punch me a\nlot...",
      "_offset": 3663,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Been there, done that!",
      "_offset": 3739,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "What's soccer? Some kind of human\nmartial arts?",
      "_offset": 3762,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "No, no!",
      "_offset": 3810,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Hey! Who are you?",
      "_offset": 3825,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "It's another fake...",
      "_offset": 3843,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "All right, let's work together!",
      "_offset": 3864,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "*whew* That's over.",
      "_offset": 3896,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "We're done with this one!",
      "_offset": 3916,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "But now we have to leave Takuya...",
      "_offset": 3942,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "We didn't get to see each other\nfor very long, but I learned a lot\nfrom you guys!",
      "_offset": 3977,
      "_length": 81,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "I'm glad I met you!",
      "_offset": 4059,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Yeah! It was fun, talking about\nsoccer!",
      "_offset": 4079,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "See you, Takuya!",
      "_offset": 4119,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Yeah, let's meet again!",
      "_offset": 4136,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "So there's another person here...\nwell, I'm gonna have to get myself\nall fired up!",
      "_offset": 4160,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "【Area 1】",
      "_offset": 4243,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "【Area 2】",
      "_offset": 4266,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "【Area 3】",
